# MINI-MOBILE-7 — Open5GS 5GC lab reference
# Sanitized example. Do not place subscriber authentication secrets here.
#
# Intended logical core address: 10.10.0.5
# UE pool: 10.20.0.0/24
# PLMN: 001/01 (international test PLMN; use a regulator-issued PLMN when required)
# TAC: 1, S-NSSAI SST: 1, DNN: internet
#
# This file is a reference, not a drop-in replacement for /etc/open5gs/*.yaml.
# Keep the installed Open5GS version pinned to v2.8.0.

# Core components that must be aligned:
#   NRF  -> serving PLMN 001/01
#   AMF  -> NGAP bind 10.10.0.5, PLMN 001/01, TAC 1, SST 1
#   SMF  -> DNN internet, UE subnet 10.20.0.0/24, UPF selection
#   UPF  -> PFCP/ GTP-U bind on the selected core interface, UE subnet 10.20.0.0/24
#   UDR/UDM/AUSF/PCF/NSSF/SCP -> default local SBA topology unless intentionally separated
#
# For exact YAML keys and defaults, use the Open5GS v2.8.0 configuration templates
# installed by the package and modify only the required values.
